  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Recommended update for openssl-3",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for openssl-3 fixes the following issues:\n\n- Build with enable-sslkeylog to support the SSLKEYLOGFILE\n  environment variable usage. (jsc#PED-17079)\n\n- Allow to bypass the strict tag initialization and length\n  enforcement added in the fix for CVE-2026-34182 when the env\n  variable OPENSSL_ALLOW_CMS_UNAUTHENTICATED_AEAD is defined and\n  set to a non-zero value. (bsc#1281325)\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "The CVRF data is provided by SUSE under the Creative Commons License 4.0 with Attribution (CC-BY-4.0).",
      "Title": "Terms of Use",
      "Type": "Legal Disclaimer"
    },
